<style>
  .uim {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 340px;
    gap: 0;
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding-top: 40px;
    color: #d6d9ea;
    background: #0b0d18;
    font: 13px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif;
  }
  .uim-stage {
    padding: 12px 8px 24px 8px;
  }
  .uim-side {
    padding: 20px 22px;
    border-left: 1px solid #23263a;
    background: #0e1120;
  }
  .uim-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Palatino, "Iowan Old Style", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #f1ead6;
  }
  .uim-side h4 {
    margin: 14px 0 4px 0;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #a99f86;
  }
  .uim-side h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .uim-side ol {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 18px;
  }
  .uim-side span,
  .uim-side .muted {
    color: #8a8ea8;
  }
  .uim-controls {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin: 14px 0 4px 0;
  }
  .uim-controls input {
    flex: 1;
  }
  .uim-btn {
    padding: 3px 10px;
    color: #111;
    background: #f0d38a;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 4px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .uim-box {
    margin-top: 12px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border: 1px solid #23263a;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .uim-legend {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 16px;
    color: #8a8ea8;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .uim {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .uim-side {
      border-left: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid #23263a;
    }
  }
</style>

<div
  class="uim">
  <div
    id="uim-stage"
    class="uim-stage">
  </div>

  <aside
    class="uim-side">
    <h1
      class="uim-title">
      The UI pyramid
    </h1>
    <p
      class="muted">
      From the browser's substrate to human needs.
      Each piece is made of pieces below it.
      Unfold it and watch what the upper layers come to lean on.
    </p>

    <div
      class="uim-controls">
      <button
        id="uim-play"
        type="button"
        class="uim-btn">
        ▶ Unfold
      </button>
      <input
        id="uim-slider"
        type="range"
        min="0"
        max="8"
        step="1" />
    </div>
    <p>
      <b
        id="uim-level">
      </b>
      <br />
      <span
        id="uim-level-note">
      </span>
    </p>

    <div
      id="uim-selection"
      class="uim-box">
    </div>

    <div
      id="uim-emergence"
      class="uim-box">
    </div>

    <h4>Reading it</h4>
    <ul
      class="uim-legend">
      <li>Blue layers are the web's; warm layers are people's; violet is where they meet.</li>
      <li>A bigger dot is used directly by more pieces.</li>
      <li>Dashed arcs: a piece built from its own layer.</li>
      <li>Dashed dots are real features from this repo.</li>
      <li>Rails on the right are qualities that cut through layers; hover for what each means.</li>
    </ul>
  </aside>
</div>

<script>
  window.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => {
    window.uiMap = window.uiPyramid();
  });
</script>
